    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Physical Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>Your upper body is split from the shoulder to the navel, like someone who’s taken a strike from a zweihander head on. While it looks ghastly, it's not painful. Decide if your skin grows over the wound or if it’s left open, or if the gash is a huge, teeth filled maw... You gain Terror 1 and Agility -10. You can only wear custom made body armour. You can only gain this mutation once.</p>"
